          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.18+HEB.12.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilh 12.18-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore ake pee ening iltung'ana pooki ndarat nedol inkiwuang'at, o embuakunoto e ntarumpeta o empuruo to ldoinyo, neirut iltung'ana neikirikira, nelamari aaitashe tenelakua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki ninche Musa, “Irorie iyie iyiook, amu eikining; kake nchoo metaa mme Enkai nairorie iyiook, mikiye ake.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Musa iltung'ana, “Emiureshoyu, amu keewuo ake Enkai atem intae, pee aa ore euriata enye nelotu dukuya nkonyek inyi, pee miasiasa ake ing'ok.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelamari iltung'ana aaitashe te nelakua, etaa kenyikaki Musa ina aimin nairrusha te ine netii Enkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inkitanapat naaipirta ilperereni loo lasarri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Olaitoriani Musa, “Ena tiaaki iltung'ana loo Siraeli: ‘Itoduaakita ntae ate nchere airorie nanu intae atii keper. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mintayuyu nkaitin e nkosholai pee eaku te nebo nanu, nimintaikiki sii ate nkaitin e sahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olperere le nkulupuoni ninye kintaikiki nanu nikipolosakiki te nchumata enye ilasarri linyi oo pejori o lasarri linyi le seriani; enker inyi o lkiteng linyi. Ore pooki wueji nagelu metadamunyeki enkarna ai naa kalotu enitii namayian intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.27.5+DEU.27.6+DEU.27.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 27.5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.8.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yosh 8.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naa ti nikintaikiki intae nanu olperere lo lasar loo soito, mishetutu too soito oogueta, amu ti niguetiguete te ntolu nisarkionienie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimikedikede too nkedeta olperere lai lo lasar, pee mimbalayuyu nchere michopopo.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
